     "why": "Conditional counts inside one GROUP BY give the resolved, cancelled and open share for each division in a single pass. It supports the finding that one division records about half its requests as open.",
     "sql": "-- q5_division_scorecard (2025; division_group joins the Parks/Forestry division renamed in 2025)\nSELECT division_group,\n       COUNT(*) AS requests,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN status_group = 'Resolved'  THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 1) AS resolved_pct,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN status_group = 'Cancelled' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 1) AS cancelled_pct,\n       ROUND(100.0 * SUM(CASE WHEN status_group = 'Open'      THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) / COUNT(*), 1) AS open_pct\nFROM stg_requests\nWHERE year = 2025\nGROUP BY division_group\nORDER BY requests DESC;"
